      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">GitHub-style heatmap of the current top 100 boys' and girls' names across the last 13 decades.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/analyses/clusters/"
       class="block p-6 bg-green-50 hover:bg-green-100 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-green-900 text-xl mb-2">Historic Clusters</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">K-means grouping of names into 4 clusters from binary vectors of historic top-100 presence.</p>
